---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ThemeSwitcher from "../components/islands/ThemeSwitcher.vue";
---

<BaseLayout title="Writasaurus License Agreement">
  <main class="page">
    <header class="header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Writasaurus home">Writasaurus</a>
      <div class="headerActions">
        <ThemeSwitcher client:load />
        <a class="headerLink" href="/">Back to home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article class="terms">
      <p class="eyebrow">Writasaurus</p>
      <h2>Writasaurus License Agreement</h2>
      <p class="updated">Paid license, account, and application use</p>

      <h3>1. Purchase and personal-use license</h3>
      <p>
        A one-time purchase grants you a personal, non-transferable license to use Writasaurus on
        up to two devices that you control. The application is licensed, not sold, and this agreement
        does not transfer ownership of Writasaurus or its included materials to you.
      </p>

      <h3>2. License key, activation, and downloads</h3>
      <p>
        A license key is associated with the email address used for purchase. Keep your key private.
        Activation requires an internet connection and is limited to two devices. The application
        stores a signed, device-bound license token and periodically contacts our license service to
        renew it. A token may allow up to 30 days of offline use; after that, an internet connection
        is needed to continue using the application. Download links require signing in to the
        purchaser account and expire.
      </p>

      <h3>3. Restrictions and revocation</h3>
      <p>
        You may not copy, modify, distribute, sublicense, sell, rent, or otherwise share or make
        Writasaurus or copies of the application available to others. These restrictions apply only
        to the application and its included materials, not to manuscripts or EPUBs you create.
        We may revoke a license for a refund, payment dispute, or material violation of this
        agreement. The application checks revocation when its signed token is renewed; a previously
        issued token can remain usable offline until it expires, for up to 30 days.
      </p>

      <h3>4. Refunds</h3>
      <p>
        You may request a full refund during the first seven days after purchase through your
        account. Approved refunds are submitted to the payment processor and revoke the associated
        license. Any mandatory rights or remedies under applicable law remain available.
      </p>

      <h3>5. Your manuscripts and EPUBs</h3>
      <p>
        You retain ownership of the writing and EPUBs you create with Writasaurus. Writasaurus
        claims no ownership of your work. You may keep, use, and distribute your manuscripts and
        EPUBs, subject to any rights belonging to other people in material you include.
      </p>

      <h3>6. Account and data</h3>
      <p>
        We use your purchase email to issue and recover your license key, provide passwordless
        account access, display purchase details, manage refunds, and make eligible downloads
        available. Payment details are handled by Stripe; we do not store full card numbers. License
        activation records include a one-way device identifier and activation timestamps. Your
        manuscripts are stored locally and are not uploaded to our account or license services.
      </p>

      <h3>7. The application</h3>
      <p>
        Writasaurus is provided as available, without promises that it will always be uninterrupted
        or error-free. Nothing in this agreement limits rights or remedies that applicable law does
        not allow to be limited.
      </p>

      <p class="draft">
        This is a plain-language product-license draft and has not been reviewed by a lawyer.
      </p>
      <a class="back" href="/">Back to Writasaurus</a>
    </article>

    <footer class="footer">
      <span>© Writasaurus</span>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.page {
  background:
    radial-gradient(
    ellipse at 78% 24%,
    color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent),
    transparent 33rem
  ),
    var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 1.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 6rem) 1.75rem;
}

.header,
.footer {
  align-items: center;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 74rem;
}

.headerActions {
  align-items: center;
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.25rem;
}

.brand {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.headerLink,
.footer a {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
}

.footer {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
}

@media (max-width: 30rem) {
  .page {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }

  .headerActions {
    align-items: flex-end;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }
}

.terms {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 70%, transparent);
  border-radius: 0.6rem 1.5rem 0.6rem 0.6rem;
  box-shadow: 0 1.4rem 3.5rem color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 12%, transparent);
  margin: 3.75rem auto 4.5rem;
  max-width: 54rem;
  padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 750;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.terms h2 {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
  font-weight: 650;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  line-height: 1.05;
}

.updated {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 1rem;
  margin: 0.8rem 0 2.5rem;
}

.terms h3 {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  margin: 1.8rem 0 0.5rem;
}

.terms > p:not(.eyebrow, .updated, .draft) {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 43rem;
}

.draft {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  padding-top: 1.25rem;
}

.back {
  color: var(--accent-strong);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
}

.back:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

@media (max-width: 48rem) {
  .terms {
    margin: 2.5rem auto 3rem;
  }
}
</style>
